{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-approval-voice#card-zh","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-approval-voice","commit":"f0ce32461edc1d2041a3de563ad7158ac1b508b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-voice（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为待处理审批、提问和计划审核提供提示音或中文语音提醒。它在 DSH 常规设置中加入提醒控制，并订阅客户端的全局交互状态；无法取得全局状态时会监听当前视图中的交互卡片。它支持全会话或仅当前会话提醒、内置或自定义提示音、音量与播报方式设置，并协调多个标签页避免重复提醒。适合希望及时注意到后台会话审批或问题的 DSH Web 用户。使用时无需 API Key；自定义音频和设置保存在浏览器 localStorage，语音播报依赖可用的中文 TTS。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:12-22","lib/client.js:609-650","lib/client.js:428-607","lib/client.js:832-873"]}
{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-approval-voice#card-en","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-approval-voice","commit":"f0ce32461edc1d2041a3de563ad7158ac1b508b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-approval-voice alerts DSH Web users to pending approvals, questions, and plan reviews with sound or Chinese speech. It watches global session state, falls back to visible cards, and offers alert controls plus cross-tab deduplication. No API key is needed; settings and audio use localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:12-22","lib/client.js:609-650","lib/client.js:428-607","lib/client.js:832-873"]}
